OROCHIMARU RESEARCH DIVISION
IMPURE WORLD REINCARNATION — IMPROVEMENT NOTES
CLEARANCE: HEAD MEDIC / RESEARCH CADRE

Purpose
The Impure World Reincarnation (Edo Tensei) was recovered and refined by Lord Orochimaru
from Second Hokage records. These notes track efforts to improve control, fidelity, and
sustainability of reincarnated subjects.

Current State
- Summoned subjects return in a deathless, regenerating body bound to a sacrifice core.
- Control is exerted through a command tag inserted into the subject; a compromised or
  removed tag returns the subject to autonomy — a serious hazard.

Improvement Lines
1. Command fidelity: strengthen the control tag so a reincarnated subject cannot be turned
   or freed by an outside seal. Highest priority.
2. Fidelity of ability: reincarnated subjects should retain their full living technique set
   and any kekkei genkai intact. Confirm no degradation across summons.
3. Material efficiency: reduce the genetic material required per summoning to conserve the
   sample library.

Cautions
The technique is forbidden and profoundly dangerous to its own caster. Testing is confined
to the expendable sacrifice pool and conducted only under the Head Medic's supervision.
Never summon without a verified control tag prepared in advance.
